## How to start a dev session

```powershell
# 1. Start Metro in its own visible window
Start-Process powershell -ArgumentList "-NoExit", "-Command", "cd 'E:\Creative\Triority\Triority'; npm start"

# 2. Verify phone is connected
adb devices   # should show R5CWC49MADM

# 3. Reverse the Metro port
adb reverse tcp:8081 tcp:8081

# 4. Press r in Metro window OR shake phone → Reload
```

**JS-only changes** (anything in App.tsx): Metro reload. No rebuild needed.  
**Native changes** (new libraries, AndroidManifest, build.gradle): must rebuild:
```powershell
cd E:\Creative\Triority\Triority\android
.\gradlew.bat --stop
.\gradlew.bat app:assembleDebug
adb install -r app\build\outputs\apk\debug\app-debug.apk
```

⚠️ **Phone is on debug APK.** If you get `INSTALL_FAILED_UPDATE_INCOMPATIBLE`, signing key changed — must uninstall first (wipes data, warn Ross).  
⚠️ **NEVER** `adb uninstall com.triority` without warning Ross — wipes all task data.

