## Backlog (don't implement without discussion)

### Must-do before any Play Store push
- **Onboarding rewrite** — Step 1 says "no projects, no labels" — wrong since multi-list. Full rewrite needed. Do after features stabilize so it doesn't go stale again. Grocery list mode will add another page (~6 steps total).

### Bugs
- ✅ **"Swipe for more" overlapping cards** — moved inline with scrollbar row; reappear bug fixed.
- ✅ **Keyboard double-tap** — edit button and PanResponderGrant call Keyboard.dismiss(); keyboardShouldPersistTaps="handled" on task ScrollView. Swipe-with-keyboard still not 100% but acceptable for now — deprioritized.

### UI / UX
- **Theme system** — ✅ Shipped. 7 themes × light/dark, 7 accent colors (one per theme, mix-and-match), mini-mockup preview cards. See `THEMES` + `ACCENT_COLORS` in App.tsx.
- **Accent palette** — ✅ Replaced 11 generic accents with exactly 7 — one extracted from each theme's signature dark default. All are visually distinct and vibrant.
- **Custom theme + accent pickers** — ⚠️ Infrastructure shipped, UI broken. See Known Issues above. What works: element pill selection, `draftRef`/`activeElRef` pattern, AsyncStorage persistence, `draftToThemeDef`, 8th theme slot. What's broken: gesture conflict, layout overflow, thumb sync lag.
- **Seasonal / event themes** — Expand beyond the current 7: 80s synthwave, 4th of July, Halloween, Christmas, summer, winter, and more. Could auto-activate by date or be user-toggled. Optional watermark-style background graphics (subtle SVG pattern — snowflakes, fireworks, etc.). Needs design: own picker section? Paid tier? Tunable opacity?
- **EditSheet redesign** — Text area + priority buttons side by side (~65% / vertical stack) to reduce height. Lower priority now that keyboard handling works.
- **Drag-and-drop task reordering** — Has been attempted before and is hard to integrate with the existing swipe gesture system. Backlog only.

### New modes / features
- **Grocery list mode** — Per-list setting (list type: Tasks | Grocery). In grocery mode: no tiers, checkboxes instead of swipe-to-complete, maybe quantity field, grouped by category. Needs design — how does it interact with archive, AI triage, reminders? Onboarding will need a page for this.
- **IAP / Triority Pro** — `useIsPaid()` stubbed `return true`. Replace with `react-native-iap` before testers. SKU: `triority_pro` at $2.99 one-time. Add Restore Purchase row to Settings. See v1.3 steps below.

### Polish
- **Swipe-to-dismiss handle UX** — Handle bar is currently just decorative when sheets use tap-to-dismiss. Now that swipe works, consider making the handle taller/more tappable.
- **Repeat reminder hint** — "Every hour until done" users may not know completing the task cancels the repeat. Subtle hint needed.
- **Manifest comment** — Comment on `SCHEDULE_EXACT_ALARM` incorrectly implies it's restricted. Low priority fix.

