## Architecture rules (do not break these)

- **Edit App.tsx with the `Edit` tool only.** Never PowerShell `Get-Content`/`Set-Content` — corrupts encoding.
- **Never `git checkout App.tsx`, `git restore`, or `git reset --hard`** without explicit approval from Ross. Past incident overwrote 1418 lines.
- **Always build/install from the main repo**, not a worktree. Worktrees caused a full session of changes to not appear on the phone.
- **Commit after every logical chunk.**
- **Multi-list migration is additive.** `tri_tasks` legacy key left in place. Don't remove yet.
- **`useIsPaid()` stub** has a warning comment in code. Don't remove it.
- **`SCHEDULE_EXACT_ALARM`** in manifest is intentional. Do NOT remove — notifications won't fire on Android 12+ without it.
- **Single-file architecture is intentional.** Don't split into multiple files.
- **Do NOT attempt react-native-reanimated or react-native-draggable-flatlist.** Both are incompatible with RN 0.85 + New Arch. See dead end note above.

